Package: ools
Version: 0.2.0-1
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: openOODA-tools <ops@openooda.org>
Description: Sovereign directory lister and metadata classifier
 An ls/eza replacement written in pure openOODA, featuring
 negative-trust capability security, file kind classification,
 oote theme palettes, and an MCP stdio surface.
